# Bulk run artifacts stay untracked (V3 plan §7, CLAUDE.md); summaries and
# verdicts are committed in the task and experiment reports.  The same one
# line as arch_surgery/MDA_partitioning_experiment_v2/.gitignore — without
# it `git status --porcelain` is never empty while runs/ exists, so every
# record this directory produces stamps `tree_git_dirty: true` and the
# clean-tree stamp the plan asks for cannot be reached.
runs/
